    <!--
    The badge images declare explicit width/height attributes (measured
    from the served SVGs on 2026-11-15) so the browser reserves their
    aspect-ratio boxes before they load; PageSpeed Insights (report of
    2026-11-15) flags them in "Image elements do not have explicit width
    and height". Shield dimensions drift as counters change, which only
    affects the reservation marginally. Markdown image syntax cannot
    carry attributes, hence raw HTML. The badges render below the fold,
    so loading="lazy" and decoding="async" defer the eight third-party
    requests (img.shields.io, wakatime.com, ~19 KiB) until they approach
    the viewport without affecting the Largest Contentful Paint.
    -->

